@startuml
!theme plain
title Kafka Consumer Client State Machine

[*] --> Created : new KafkaConsumer()

Created --> Subscribed : subscribe(topics) / join consumer group
Created --> Assigned : assign(partitions) / manual assignment
Created --> Closed : close() / cleanup resources

Subscribed --> JoiningGroup : first poll() / initiate group join
Assigned --> Polling : poll() / start fetching

JoiningGroup --> Rebalancing : group coordinator response / partition assignment
JoiningGroup --> JoinFailed : join timeout/coordinator unavailable
JoiningGroup --> Closed : close() during join

JoinFailed --> JoiningGroup : retry() [retry < maxRetries] / backoff delay
JoinFailed --> Closed : [retry >= maxRetries] / give up

Rebalancing --> Polling : rebalance complete / partitions assigned
Rebalancing --> RebalanceFailed : rebalance timeout/error
Rebalancing --> Closed : close() during rebalance

RebalanceFailed --> Rebalancing : retry rebalance / coordinator retry
RebalanceFailed --> Closed : fatal rebalance error / leave group

Polling --> Fetching : poll(timeout) / fetch records from brokers
Polling --> Paused : pause(partitions) / suspend fetching
Polling --> Closed : close() / leave group and cleanup

Paused --> Polling : resume(partitions) / resume fetching
Paused --> Closed : close() / cleanup

Fetching --> Processing : records received / return to application
Fetching --> FetchTimeout : poll timeout / no records available
Fetching --> FetchError : fetch error/broker unavailable
Fetching --> Rebalancing : rebalance triggered / partition reassignment

FetchTimeout --> Polling : continue polling / heartbeat maintained
FetchTimeout --> Closed : close() / shutdown

FetchError --> Polling : [recoverable error] / retry fetch
FetchError --> Closed : [fatal error] / shutdown consumer

Processing --> Committing : commitSync()/commitAsync() / offset commit
Processing --> Polling : next poll() / continue consumption
Processing --> Seeking : seek(partition, offset) / reset position
Processing --> Closed : close() / shutdown

Committing --> CommitSuccess : commit acknowledged / offsets stored
Committing --> CommitFailed : commit error/coordinator unavailable

CommitSuccess --> Polling : continue consumption
CommitSuccess --> Closed : close() / shutdown

CommitFailed --> Committing : retry commit [retriable error]
CommitFailed --> Polling : [non-retriable error] / continue without commit
CommitFailed --> Closed : close() / shutdown

Seeking --> Polling : seek complete / new position set
Seeking --> Closed : close() / shutdown

Closed --> [*] : resources released

note right of JoiningGroup : Consumer group protocol\nHeartbeat thread started\nCoordinator discovery
note right of Rebalancing : Partition assignment\nRevoke/assign callbacks\nOffset reset strategy
note right of Fetching : Fetch from assigned partitions\nDeserialize records\nHandle fetch errors
note right of Processing : Application logic\nRecord processing\nError handling
note right of Committing : Offset management\nAt-least-once/at-most-once\nCommit strategies

state Polling {
  [*] --> Heartbeating
  Heartbeating --> SessionTimeout : session.timeout.ms exceeded
  SessionTimeout --> [*] : trigger rebalance
  Heartbeating --> [*] : normal operation
}

state Processing {
  [*] --> Deserializing
  Deserializing --> ApplicationLogic : records deserialized
  ApplicationLogic --> [*] : processing complete
  Deserializing --> DeserializationError : deserialization failed
  DeserializationError --> [*] : error handled
}

state Rebalancing {
  [*] --> PartitionRevocation
  PartitionRevocation --> PartitionAssignment : revoke complete
  PartitionAssignment --> OffsetReset : assignment complete
  OffsetReset --> [*] : positions determined
}

@enduml